expression: "render(r#\"Control(If(\n            condition: Enchanted,\n            of: Some(TargetFoe),\n            then: [Damage(to: TargetFoe, amount: Scaled(10, 100))],\n        ))\"#)"
---
If target foe is enchanted, target foe takes 10…100 damage.
